  << /ActualText (The school \04242 Wolfsburg\042 is an innovative institution for software engineering with a project\055based\054 \npeer\055to\055peer learning approach\056 The completion is certified with the RNCP 6\0560 by the French government\054\nwhich corresponds to the level of a Bachelor\047s degree\056 Practical projects include\072\nWriting my own shell for the terminal\054 implementing command parsing and process handling\056\nDeveloping a web server capable of handling multiple clients simultaneously without blocking\054 showcasing non\055blocking I\057O principles\056\nBuilding a full\055stack website\054 including frontend design\054 backend logic\054 and database management\056\nWorking with Docker to containerize applications\054 ensuring portability and scalability\056\nAdministering Linux systems\054 gaining hands\055on experience in system management\054 networking\054 and automation\056)
